## Metal Substitution as the Method of Modifying Electronic Structure of
## Metal-Organic Frameworks
Maria A. Syzgantseva,† Christopher Patrick Ireland,‡ Fatmah Mish Ebrahim,‡
†Laboratory of Quantum Mechanics and Molecular Structure, Department of Chemistry, Moscow State University M.V. Lomonosov, Moscow, Russia
